29
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">mou ikkai</font></font></font></b></font>

30
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release the Genjutsu and
wake up Naruto and Shikamaru.</font>

32
00:01:35,450 --> 00:01:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll be getting a mission
after such a long while.</font>

33
00:01:38,030 --> 00:01:39,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by a mission?</font>

34
00:01:40,030 --> 00:01:41,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful...</font>

35
00:01:42,990 --> 00:01:46,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first A-Ranked mission
since the Land of the Waves.</font>

36
00:01:51,540 --> 00:01:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

37
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were able to release
the Genjutsu too!</font>

38
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why were you pretending
to be asleep?!</font>

39
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Track down Sasuke,
join up and then stop him!</font>

40
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then await next orders
in a safe place.</font>

41
00:02:05,850 --> 00:02:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Did something happen to Sasuke?!</font>

42
00:02:08,730 --> 00:02:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell you the reason en route!</font>

43
00:02:11,230 --> 00:02:12,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

44
00:02:13,190 --> 00:02:14,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!</font>

45
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it! So that's what happened!</font>

46
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:41,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Sasuke, getting all impatient!</font>

47
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, why am I pulled into this?
This is such a drag!</font>

48
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped!</font>

49
00:02:50,190 --> 00:02:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Kakashi-sensei's order.</font>

50
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way!</font>

51
00:03:00,490 --> 00:03:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long will it be until
we catch up?</font>

52
00:03:02,410 --> 00:03:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.
He is moving at a pretty good speed.</font>

53
00:03:06,410 --> 00:03:07,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

54
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:17,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Coward</font>

55
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:17,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">N 1</font>

56
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:17,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><u>o</u></font>

57
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:17,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">It's Troublesome,</font>

58
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:17,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">But I've Got to Do It!!</font>

59
00:03:39,990 --> 00:03:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hurry it up, you guys.</font>

60
00:03:42,610 --> 00:03:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What is it?</font>

61
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you find Sasuke?</font>

62
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

63
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are eight people in
two squads behind us...</font>

64
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

65
00:03:51,540 --> 00:03:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's one more...
There are nine people following us.</font>

66
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

67
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon. Already?!
Give me a break!</font>

68
00:04:19,650 --> 00:04:23,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks they haven't grasped
our location, yet.</font>

69
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must lose them.</font>

70
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what's the point of stopping?!</font>

71
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up and follow me!</font>

72
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

73
00:04:47,970 --> 00:04:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going back over our footprints.</font>

74
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we do that,</font>

75
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'll look to them like our footprints
suddenly disappeared.</font>

76
00:04:57,650 --> 00:05:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, they'll notice even
if we do this, right?</font>

77
00:05:03,610 --> 00:05:07,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll buy us some time.
That's enough.</font>

78
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:12,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be a matter for great celebration
if our pursuers get impatient,</font>

79
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">cloud their eyes of pursuit
and lose sight of the trail.</font>

80
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

81
00:05:21,210 --> 00:05:22,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time.</font>

82
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:25,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I know!</font>

83
00:05:50,660 --> 00:05:51,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not good.</font>

84
00:05:52,410 --> 00:05:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though they're on
alert for ambushes,</font>

85
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're catching up with us
slowly, but surely.</font>

86
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:57,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

87
00:05:58,500 --> 00:06:00,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably they're all Chunin or higher.</font>

88
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:03,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be wiped out if they catch up.</font>

89
00:06:04,210 --> 00:06:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wiped out...</font>

90
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Since it's come to this,
why don't we ambush them?!</font>

91
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:11,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ambush?</font>

92
00:06:11,970 --> 00:06:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

93
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:16,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, an ambush would
be to our advantage.</font>

94
00:06:16,850 --> 00:06:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if the opponent has twice
the people than we do,</font>

95
00:06:20,150 --> 00:06:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we just catch them off-guard...</font>

96
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's no good.</font>

97
00:06:24,110 --> 00:06:27,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our opponents are former
Leaf Shinobi Orochimaru's henchmen.</font>

98
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the worst case scenario,
there might be Jonin.</font>

99
00:06:32,530 --> 00:06:35,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it'd work,
but I guess not, huh.</font>

100
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:38,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it. Why?</font>

101
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:41,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The level of opponent doesn't have
much to do with an ambush.</font>

102
00:06:42,590 --> 00:06:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

103
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys don't get it.</font>

104
00:06:48,050 --> 00:06:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen. Indeed, an ambush is
a very advantageous fundamental tactic.</font>

105
00:06:53,180 --> 00:06:56,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But two conditions are necessary.</font>

106
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are those necessary conditions?</font>

107
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Number one.</font>

108
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:05,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ones on the run must act without
making noise and find the enemy first.</font>

109
00:07:06,530 --> 00:07:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Number two.</font>

110
00:07:07,990 --> 00:07:10,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One must be able to catch
the pursuers off guard,</font>

111
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:14,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">capture a point and position
to be able to inflict certain damage,</font>

112
00:07:14,450 --> 00:07:16,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and conceal oneself quickly.</font>

113
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah... Huh?</font>

114
00:07:18,790 --> 00:07:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An ambush only becomes effective
when these two conditions are ensured.</font>

115
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:28,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the first condition
won't be so difficult</font>

116
00:07:28,380 --> 00:07:30,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">since we have the Ninja Hound's nose.</font>

117
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the second one also
seems advantageous at a glance</font>

118
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:37,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">since we know the geography
of our village.</font>

119
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:41,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Orochimaru has spent time
in the Leaf before.</font>

120
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:44,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That approach won't work
on his henchmen.</font>

121
00:07:45,690 --> 00:07:47,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what do you really mean?</font>

122
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:50,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our pursuers must have been instructed
in the terrain of this village</font>

123
00:07:50,610 --> 00:07:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and have gone through
simulated practice for this fight.</font>

124
00:07:55,030 --> 00:07:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And on top of that,</font>

125
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're probably all Ninja
who have mastered the pursuit arts.</font>

126
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:02,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So they know what cards we have, huh.</font>

127
00:08:03,290 --> 00:08:07,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, even so, the fact remains
that an ambush is advantageous.</font>

128
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there are too many elements
of uncertainty.</font>

129
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place, the enemy is
a special unit organized for this operation.</font>

130
00:08:15,550 --> 00:08:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we have a fool...</font>

131
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:20,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a Kunoichi who's nothing special...</font>

132
00:08:22,180 --> 00:08:23,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and one dog...</font>

133
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:27,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and, me with the number-one cold feet!</font>

134
00:08:28,230 --> 00:08:32,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A tactic is grasping the conditions
that are there without fail</font>

135
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:33,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and formulating an optimal plan.</font>

136
00:08:34,950 --> 00:08:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so, there's only one thing
that we can do now...</font>

137
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One?</font>

138
00:08:41,290 --> 00:08:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A diversion in the guise
of an ambush.</font>

139
00:08:44,790 --> 00:08:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One person will remain,
pretend to ambush,</font>

140
00:08:48,090 --> 00:08:49,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and delay the pursuers.</font>

141
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

142
00:08:53,170 --> 00:08:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">bait.</font>

143
00:08:55,550 --> 00:08:59,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. If we delay them,</font>

144
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they won't be able to grasp
the positions of the remaining three.</font>

145
00:09:02,350 --> 00:09:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we do that, we'll be able
to shake off our pursuers,</font>

146
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but the one who has become
the bait will probably...</font>

147
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">die.</font>

148
00:09:44,350 --> 00:09:46,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, who's going to do it?</font>

149
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need the dog to follow Sasuke.</font>

150
00:09:55,950 --> 00:09:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means...</font>

151
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine...</font>

152
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I'll...
— I guess it has to be me.</font>

153
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:09,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru?!</font>

154
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why you?!</font>

155
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's better than being wiped out, right?</font>

156
00:10:16,170 --> 00:10:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, among us,</font>

157
00:10:17,510 --> 00:10:19,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the only one who is equal
to playing the bait</font>

158
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and who has the possibility
of surviving...</font>

159
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is me.</font>

160
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu is an Art
originally intended as a delay tactic, so...</font>

161
00:10:35,730 --> 00:10:37,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'll catch up later!</font>

162
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now get going!</font>

163
00:10:45,410 --> 00:10:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're counting on you, Shikamaru!</font>

164
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

165
00:10:56,090 --> 00:10:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

166
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:09,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was Shikamaru ever this reliable
of a character?</font>

167
00:11:13,610 --> 00:11:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful...</font>

168
00:11:16,070 --> 00:11:16,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru.</font>

169
00:11:45,140 --> 00:11:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how much you try to erase
the signs of your presence...</font>

170
00:11:50,770 --> 00:11:51,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're in plain view.</font>

171
00:11:56,730 --> 00:11:59,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! The enemy is approaching fast.</font>

172
00:11:59,900 --> 00:12:01,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

173
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he's really
delaying the enemy.</font>

174
00:12:06,330 --> 00:12:08,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me with the number-one cold feet!</font>

175
00:12:09,830 --> 00:12:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me, Shikamaru...</font>

176
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru will be okay!</font>

177
00:12:15,170 --> 00:12:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me, he ran away.</font>

178
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said he'll be okay!</font>

179
00:12:20,130 --> 00:12:21,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What'll be okay?!</font>

180
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:24,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has a dirty mouth and
always says stuff is a pain.</font>

181
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:26,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he wouldn't betray us!</font>

182
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He hardly ever says
he'll do something himself,</font>

183
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he makes sure to do it
if he says it!</font>

184
00:12:34,770 --> 00:12:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's absolute.</font>

185
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:40,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to believe...
I want to believe, but...</font>

186
00:12:41,610 --> 00:12:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pick up the pace!</font>

187
00:12:51,830 --> 00:12:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I somehow managed to
get away completely.</font>

188
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their strides are irregular.</font>

189
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Urgency is probably increasing
their fatigue.</font>

190
00:13:18,690 --> 00:13:19,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry about that.</font>

191
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was supposed to be the guy
with the number one cold feet.</font>

192
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems my character has
changed just a bit this time.</font>

193
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that I'm tired is true.</font>

194
00:13:33,290 --> 00:13:35,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those footprints are wrong.</font>

195
00:13:36,290 --> 00:13:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, this is what
the dog's paw print really is.</font>

196
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, he's still a kid.</font>

197
00:13:54,060 --> 00:13:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think we'd all get caught like this.</font>

198
00:13:56,980 --> 00:14:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the rumored Leaf Village's
Shadow Paralysis Jutsu, huh?</font>

199
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's an old way of saying it!</font>

200
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:07,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The times are passing!</font>

201
00:14:07,570 --> 00:14:11,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's called Shadow Possession Jutsu now,
old man.</font>

202
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:17,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough,
that match wasn't good.</font>

203
00:14:27,380 --> 00:14:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I used too much Chakra.
I can't hang on much longer...</font>

204
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1, 2, 3, 4...</font>

205
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">5, 6, 7... 8.</font>

206
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight people...</font>

207
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:48,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight... No, there's one more...</font>

208
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are nine people following us.</font>

209
00:14:52,410 --> 00:14:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, the ninth person's role is
to protect against them getting ambushed.</font>

210
00:14:57,700 --> 00:14:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person stays at a fixed distance,</font>

211
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:02,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">moves in the back and responds
to an enemy attack.</font>

212
00:15:10,180 --> 00:15:15,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... this will make clear where
that person's hiding!</font>

213
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There, huh?!</font>

214
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... The Shadow won't reach.</font>

215
00:15:40,710 --> 00:15:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have the stamina to
send it to Chakra.</font>

216
00:15:44,500 --> 00:15:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile. I see through your technique.</font>

217
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:52,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this as far as it goes?</font>

218
00:15:52,890 --> 00:15:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like you're at your limit...</font>

219
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:58,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Shadow Possession Jutsu
is going to break very soon.</font>

220
00:15:58,720 --> 00:15:59,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourself!</font>

221
00:16:11,530 --> 00:16:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to...
become a Ninja any which way,</font>

222
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">save up money any which way,</font>

223
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">get married any which way to
an ordinary woman</font>

224
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:21,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who's neither beautiful nor ugly</font>

225
00:16:21,620 --> 00:16:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and have two kids any which way.</font>

226
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First will be a girl, and then a boy...</font>

227
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would retire from being a Ninja
when my eldest daughter marries</font>

228
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and my son becomes a full-fledged man.</font>

229
00:16:32,930 --> 00:16:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then I take it easy
in my life of retirement</font>

230
00:16:36,470 --> 00:16:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">playing Shogi
and Go the whole day.</font>

231
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I die of old age before my wife.</font>

232
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a life would've been nice.</font>

233
00:16:45,730 --> 00:16:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was out of character,
I tried too hard this time.</font>

234
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:50,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted it to end in an ordinary way.</font>

235
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:54,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I did was a drag...</font>

236
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, the movements of
our pursuers have stopped.</font>

237
00:17:01,870 --> 00:17:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! The delaying was a success!</font>

238
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, eh?</font>

239
00:17:08,670 --> 00:17:11,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry I doubted you, even a little.</font>

240
00:17:12,420 --> 00:17:13,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

241
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... you wait, Sasuke.</font>

242
00:17:19,050 --> 00:17:21,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... Shikamaru...</font>

243
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Live, and catch up to us no matter what!</font>

244
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you say, it seems I'm at my limit.</font>

245
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, come on out.</font>

246
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:51,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While you're at it, cut off his head.</font>

247
00:18:07,730 --> 00:18:09,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally caught up.</font>

248
00:18:10,310 --> 00:18:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Asuma?! Why?</font>

249
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done, Shikamaru.</font>

250
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, out of character.</font>

251
00:19:20,130 --> 00:19:23,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the time being, you retire here.</font>

252
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:29,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

253
00:19:36,570 --> 00:19:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pest.</font>

254
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:44,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pursuers have increased?
Two? No, three?</font>

255
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:47,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro! Pick up the pace!</font>

256
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:49,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

257
00:19:57,460 --> 00:19:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away.</font>

258
00:20:02,630 --> 00:20:05,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't jump the gun, Sasuke.</font>

259
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun.</font>

260
00:20:56,810 --> 00:20:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, shall we begin?</font>

261
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

262
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

263
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

264
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

265
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

266
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

267
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

268
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

269
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

270
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

271
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

272
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

273
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

274
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

275
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

276
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

277
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

278
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

279
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

280
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

281
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

282
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

283
00:22:47,630 --> 00:22:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I don't know what's going on!</font>

284
00:22:50,760 --> 00:22:53,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Why is Old Man Hokage
fighting with Orochimaru?</font>

285
00:22:53,510 --> 00:22:55,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Why is Sasuke going after
that guy with shadows around his eyes?</font>

286
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:59,310
